Description: Gwenview's per-file 3D entries are the stereo layer's menu and store (ORDER 551)
 For a local file the 3D menu shows Stereo::FileChoiceMenu, and the choices (the input packing, Not 3D, the swap) are
 kept in the layer's per-file store, which Dolphin and the thumbnailers read. The adapter decodes through the layer with
 the file's path. The session keeps which eye is shown. The swaps kept in gwenviewstereorc are taken into the store
 once. Needs libstereo-layer-dev (>= 1.18.0).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
